# Cryptic Coat's "equipped creature ... can't be blocked" is the Equipment's static ability, not an ability the creature
# has: there is no "has" or "gains" (CR 113.1a). Turn to Frog, cast later at the equipped Llanowar Elves (cloaked by the Coat,
# then turned face up for {G}), takes the Elves' "{T}: Add {G}" (CR 613.1f) but not the Coat's restriction (CR 509.1b): Bot2's
# Ornithopter may not block the Frog (the refusal), a 2/1 with the Coat's +1/+0, and Bot2 takes 2.

